              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "**25-year-old** – has decades ahead, so can keep most of the money in stocks and ride out crashes",
                "**60-year-old** – will need the money in a few years, so moves part of it into bonds and cash"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "Risk should **go down along with the time** left until you withdraw."
