    {
      "id": "l2",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "How much do I need for retirement",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "How much do I need for retirement"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/2-ile-potrzebuje-na-emeryture.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Work out how much you'll spend per month in retirement and subtract the state pension. **The missing amount** comes from your own savings."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A starting point is the **4% rule**: if you withdraw about 4% of the portfolio each year, it should last for many years."
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "Example: an extra **400 €** a month ≈ **120,000 €** of capital. It's a rule of thumb, not a guarantee."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      },
      "tasks": []
